    "text": "Her onginne\u00f0 seo \u00e6ftre boc dialogorum be life & wundrum sanctus Benedictes abbodes.\nHer uppyrne\u00f0 se \u00e6ftera stream \u00f0\u00e6re godcundan spr\u00e6ce, se cym\u00f0 of \u00feam burnon \u00fe\u00e6s gastlican\n\u00deysum wordum se ylca gyldenmu\u00f0a Gregorius w\u00e6s sprekende & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, sum w\u00e6s arwur\u00f0es lifes\nSe of \u00fe\u00e6re tide his cnihthades w\u00e6s berende ealdlice heortan & oferstah his ylde mid godum \u00feeawum\nAc \u00fea \u00fea he w\u00e6s \u00fea gita on \u00feissere eor\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t he mihte freolice brucan hwilwendlicra \u00feinga, \u00fea\nHe w\u00e6s geboren of freogum & of \u00e6\u00f0elum kynrene of Nursie \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e & w\u00e6s bef\u00e6sted to\nAc \u00fea \u00fea he on \u00feam geseah fela manna faran \u00feurh \u00fea st\u00e6\u00f0hlepan hyra leahtra, \u00fea wi\u00f0teah he his\n\u00deam he wi\u00f0br\u00e6d, \u00fee l\u00e6s hw\u00e6t unrihtes hine on his ge\u00feance gehrine, & he sylf sy\u00f0\u00f0on ferde eall on\nWitodlice forsewenum bigengum \u00feara boccr\u00e6fta he forlet his f\u00e6der hus & \u00e6hta & gewilnode, \u00fe\u00e6t\nHe gewat \u00feanone swi\u00f0e gewissfullice, swilce he ungewis w\u00e6re, & ferde swy\u00f0e wislice swa\nNe leornode ic na ealle \u00feyses halgan weres d\u00e6da, ac \u00fea feawa, \u00fee ic cy\u00f0e, ic oncneow \u00e6t his feower\nWitodlice \u00fea \u00fea se halga wer Benedictus eallunga forlet to leornienne \u00fea boccr\u00e6ftas, \u00fea geteohhode\n\u00dea \u00fea hi becomon to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe, \u00fee is genemned Effide, \u00fea gewunedon hi \u00fe\u00e6r mid manegum\n\u00dea weras hi \u00fe\u00e6r mid so\u00f0re lufe geh\u00e6fdon on \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan Petres cyricean.",
